 "text": "Hello, how are things going? That's annoying, but usually nothing serious. Lube the chain with something quieter, and check the chain and gears for wear anyway. It works and cooks dinner while you' at it. A little goes a long way. Pop the chain off and drizzle it in the links. Turn the chain with a screwdriver before you thread it back on. Clean it with a little oil first, it goes faster. A little quieter is enough. Go too heavy and you' start grease spotting your clothes.",
